===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vledermūs}}, from {{inh|de|goh|fledarmūs}}; derived from {{m|goh|fledarōn|t=flutter}} << {{der|de|gem-pro|*fifaldǭ}} and {{m|goh|mus|t=Maus}} << {{der|de|gmw-pro|*mūs}}; not equivalent to {{compound|de|flattern|Maus|nocat=1}} which would give ''*Flattermaus''.

